abstract: >-
  AISKG v3.1.2 preserves the frozen v3.0.0 manuscript pipeline, adds complete
  reviewer-level replay of expanded blinded pathway validation from three
  public metadata-sanitized completed workbooks, and retains the corrected
  three-system held-out biomedical NLP benchmark introduced in v3.1.1.
